  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av Barnmorske - Fistula program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Scaling up of Midwifery - Fistula Programme - UNFPA Technical Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att bidra till minskad m&#xf6;drad&#xf6;dlighet genom tillg&#xe5;ng till    utbildade barnmorskor vid f&#xf6;dseln och fistulav&#xe5;rd. Det svenska st&#xf6;det f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rker p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende barnmorskeprogrammet och f&#xf6;r att integrera        obstetrisk fistulav&#xe5;rd inom akut f&#xf6;rlossningsv&#xe5;rd. En komponent att   utbilda narkosteam ing&#xe5;r ocks&#xe5;. Det svenska st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r integrerat i    FNs gemensamma givarprogram f&#xf6;r m&#xf6;dra- och sp&#xe4;dbarnsh&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to contribute to decreased maternal death through skilled attendance at birth and fistula care. The Swedish support is to scale up the ongoing midwifery programme and to integrate obstetric fistula care into emergency obstetric care services. A component to           strengthening the anaesthesia training team is also included. Swedish support is integrated in the new UN maternal health joint Programme</narrative>
  </description>
